    "name": "FCC Area and Census Block API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The FCC Area and Census Block API returns US Census Bureau Census Block FIPS codes, county FIPS codes, state FIPS codes, and associated US State and County names based on latitude and longitude coordinates. Also returns market data and population data. All endpoints are free with no authentication required.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Federal Communications Commission",
      "type": "text/plain"
